.TH xyrev-dotfile-archive 1  "xyrev-dotfile-archive "
.SH NAME
xyrev\-dotfile\-archive \- Export rendered target files as tar, tar.gz, or zip
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxyrev\-dotfile\-archive\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export rendered target files as tar, tar.gz, or zip
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: tar]

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRtar, tgz, zip]
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
